WEBVTT

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.870
Mom!

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.040
What's that cool pose?

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.500
This is no "cool pose."

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.670
It's called the Spell of Rightful Belonging.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.550
It's a meditative technique for
sealing away all that is unearthly.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.340
You look like a transforming hero!

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.720
Okay, I'll be the monster!

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:34.350
I am not a transforming superhero.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.930
I'm a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:38.980
But a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden fights for justice, right?

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.140
So you <i>are</i> a hero!

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.400
I must admit the validity of your logic.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.900
Then here I come!

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.400
The Spell of Rightful Belonging!

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.400
There! Take that!

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.900
There's no yelling involved!

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.860
And your form is incorrect!

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.740
It's cooler this way!

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.740
Looks stronger too, so it'll scare the enemy!

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:55.410
Take this!

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.450
Is that so important?

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.290
Take this?

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:00.620
I can't hear you, Mom!

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:01.710
Don't underestimate me!

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:03.540
Behold my true capability!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:04.290
Take this!

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:06.880
What's wrong, Sasami?

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:07.630
What's so funny?

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.510
I love you, Mom!

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:13.260
What an odd child.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:20.480
Take that!

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:59.080
<i>Things weren't always so happy.</i>

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:02.250
<i>Tsurugi-nee never used to try so hard.</i>

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:05.290
<i>She was tired of everything and was always spacing out.</i>

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:23.220
<i>Kagami-nee would never smile, and she'd never talk.</i>

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.350
<i>It was like the littlest sounds frightened her.</i>

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.650
<i>And like she was always fighting something you couldn't see.</i>

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.330
<i>So I was the one who smiled.</i>

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.540
<i>I thought "I gotta smile," so I smiled.</i>

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:44.790
<i>Bad stuff was happening to me, too.</i>

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:48.080
<i>Kids picked on me at school,
and I was scolded by the teachers.</i>

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.290
<i>But I told myself that I should still put on a happy face.</i>

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:09.270
<i>There wasn't anything I could do,
so I just pretended that I was really happy.</i>

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:13.900
<i>To get Tsurugi-nee and Kagami-nee to laugh with me, I laughed all the time.</i>

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:17.280
<i>Even if they said I was annoying, or yelled at me,</i>

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.820
<i>I still did all that I could so that
I wouldn't start hating this world.</i>

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:22.910
<i>I really tried hard.</i>

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.500
You idiot!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.040
You're useless!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.170
<i>The look on Tsurugi-nee and Kagami-nee's faces grew softer over time,</i>

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:36.550
<i>and as we spent time with Mamarin, they started smiling more.</i>

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:38.010
<i>With more silly incidents going on,</i>

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:41.890
<i>I thought their stress melted away completely.</i>

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:44.600
<i>But then it all got ruined.</i>

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.230
<i>Tsurugi-nee was pushed down into the netherworld.</i>

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.440
<i>Kagami-nee is badly hurt and can't move.</i>

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:58.070
<i>But I'm okay.</i>

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.200
<i>I'm the only one who's okay.</i>

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.610
<i>So I have to go.</i>

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.490
<i>I'm scared, and I can't stop crying,</i>

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.740
<i>but I'll keep walking forward.</i>

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.870
<i>If you're going to grant a wish for me,</i>

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.830
<i>then please, God, let me grant theirs!</i>

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.210
Huh?

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:22.590
Don't move.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.220
I'm renewing your body.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:28.220
<i>I'm not free to move.</i>

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:31.310
It seems you haven't been living a healthy life.

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:35.730
Your frail body will bring you to an early death if you don't gain some weight.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.690
<i>What is this?</i>

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:39.740
<i>I feel hazy.</i>

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:43.200
I used medication to weaken your consciousness.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.870
It would be problematic if you were to
exercise the power of the supreme god.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.500
<i>Why? Where am I?</i>

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:53.500
We're on the grounds where
Tsukuyomi Shrine once stood.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:57.090
Although the shrine no longer exists,

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:00.260
it's a good place for training, away from the secular realm.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.340
By purifying it and reestablishing the barrier,

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.640
I'll restore it to an isolated environment, just for the Tsukuyomi shrine maidens.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:09.220
Let me ask you once more.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.390
This is the best compromise I can offer.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.440
Will you never think about running away again

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.190
and serve the world and humanity?

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:20.150
Do you pledge to fulfill your duties as a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden?

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:22.400
No.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.950
Why won't you?

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:27.030
You pledged to return to your duties as a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:31.080
I did that... to stop you.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.870
Then were you lying to me?

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:36.330
You've drugged me to force me to agree.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.540
But I don't want to.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.670
It's a useless job that ultimately killed you.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:42.670
I don't want to do it.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:48.010
Not after I finally went out into the outside world.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:51.100
Not after I finally made friends.

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:53.690
Are you going to abandon the role you were destined to fill?!

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:56.310
This isn't what I wanted.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:07:00.280
As much as time permits, I will reeducate you.

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:02.360
No, no...

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:05.320
I won't work hard anymore.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:08.450
I see.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.450
Then I'm left with no further options.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:19.460
You've always vomited a lot.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.130
Since you might throw up if I were to deposit it in your mouth,

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.130
I'm inserting the drug directly into your stomach.

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:27.760
I had left some of your consciousness so I could question you,

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:32.930
but once this drug comes into full effect,
you will completely lose your ability to think.

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:37.440
The time for me to ask you questions is over.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.940
The time for you to tell me things is over.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.940
The time for me to expect things of your human life...

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:45.820
is over.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.950
It's unfortunate, Sasami.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.200
Truly unfortunate.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.710
He disappointed me as well.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.130
While he's always been an
incompetent, indulgent man,

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:02.960
not only did he let the
Tsukuyomi Shrine be destroyed,

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.340
he took matters into his own hands and failed miserably.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:07.180
Irredeemable.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:12.140
If you can't fulfill your duty, you're worthless.

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:14.970
However, I won't let the Tsukuyomi bloodline end.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.560
As such, there is only one thing I now want from you.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.940
Birth me a child, Sasami.

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:26.610
That child will inherit the power of the supreme god

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.490
and become the next Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:32.080
Once the power has been transferred, you may go wherever you please.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:37.540
As I had poor health and couldn't give birth to many children,

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.960
not many people with our blood remain.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.080
Make do with him.

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:42.840
No.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.130
No, no!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:46.710
I don't want to!

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:48.760
Don't be a stubborn girl.

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:51.890
Be impregnated by him, and give birth to a new Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:55.350
I will educate her and restore this world to its proper form.

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.730
No, no!

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:58.640
At least...

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:03.400
At least let me do it with my big brother.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:04.770
I cannot allow that.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.030
He is no longer considered a member of the Tsukuyomi family.

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:11.910
That man committed the greatest crime: taking you and running away.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:14.660
Thus I can't allow his involvement in Tsukuyomi family matters.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:21.670
And that man did come here earlier, probably to take you away,

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:26.250
but since he was making such a noise,
saying he wanted see you, I dealt with him.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.720
Cleanse your body first.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:35.050
Burn incense, perform the ritual,

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.600
and pray for a child.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.060
Oh, the trauma must've been too much.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.020
Well, that is fine.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:42.560
As long as your body is functional, it will not present a problem.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:52.360
I told Sasami of her final duty.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.910
She quietened down when
I told her you were dead.

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:58.370
She must be quite fond of you.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.540
How dare a vexatious monster like you...

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.050
I'd kill you if I could.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:14.680
Are you really going to use Sasami-san as a tool for giving birth to a new Tsukuyomi shrine maiden?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:18.140
Have you lost all love you had for Sasami as her mother?

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:23.230
When I returned from the underworld, I ceased to be human.

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:26.440
Before being her mother,
I am a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:30.690
Sasami-san really loved you.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.200
I am aware of that.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.950
However, that is but an insignificant trifle...

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.080
Brother.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.000
Awakening from condensed sleep.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.420
Assessing damage.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:48.250
Automatic damage repair at 38 percent.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.510
Seven more hours until
physically capable of combat.

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.550
Sasami-san...

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.850
Are you worried about me, Meat-chan?

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:05.270
We're up against the mightiest
Tsukuyomi shrine maiden in history,

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:08.020
now under the protection of the king of the netherworld.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.990
Without a careful plan,
even Tama will fare no better than us.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.990
The king of the netherworld...

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:18.490
That is to say, the hero god and the incarnation of storm, Susanoo.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:24.210
Susanoo opposes the principles of order and control upheld by Amaterasu,

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.120
advancing chaos and rebellion.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:29.000
He is the most troublesome opponent for us.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.840
Fortunately, I have a GPS-like capability.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:37.680
I don't care if you're a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden or the hero god.

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:40.930
Don't dare underestimate the Yagami sisters!

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:46.600
I'm leaving the rest to you, Tama.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.490
I must somehow go save Sasami-san!

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:00.370
What a fright!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.240
This is Tsurugi-sensei's...

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.370
Just what I needed.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.250
Huh?

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:09.500
This sword doesn't cut
as well as you'd think.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:13.590
Okay, now I can get out of this...

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:16.720
Gah, that won't stop me!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.810
Sasami-san's scent is...

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:25.230
This way!

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.770
It's this room!

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:40.870
Sasami-san!

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:42.370
Sasami-san, it's me!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.240
I'm here to save you, Sasami-san!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.000
You can rest assured now.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:50.580
I'll protect you, no matter what happens!

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:02.800
O-Onii-chan?

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:04.350
You're alive.

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:07.600
Yes, I'm alive, Sasami-san.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.980
So please, stop crying.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.270
Onii-chan!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.320
Ow!

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:15.530
Huh?!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.570
I don't understand what's going on!

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:22.160
You were supposed to hug me tight,
kiss me on the cheek, and say you love me!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:25.240
Your "rescue" came too late, you idiot!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.290
You stupid, useless dimwit!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.540
You piece of trash, scum, bug!

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.880
It's all right now, Sasami-san.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.720
I'll protect you.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.340
Onii-chan...

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:49.520
Did you think I would let you get away?

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:56.020
I didn't think it could break the barrier when thrown from a distance.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.610
No less from the divine sword, Gathering Clouds of Heaven,

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:01.990
a sacred blade of protection that purifies all that is evil.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.360
However...

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:08.950
She sent only her weapon
and did not appear herself,

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.620
which must mean those
evil gods still cannot mobilize.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.460
Let us go, Mom.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:15.880
I won't have any children.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.920
There's no point in continuing the Tsukuyomi lineage.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:18.840
It will end with my generation.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:22.800
That's what I've decided.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:25.350
Humans forced the world
into this distorted state.

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:27.470
I'll restore the chaos that
existed before the age of myths.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.350
That's the way the world should be.

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:36.480
Even if I'm beaten, tortured,
and brainwashed to become your tool,

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.400
my heart will not falter.

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:40.240
You worked so hard,

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.070
to let go of everything,

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:45.620
ignoring your share of happiness and joy in life

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:48.080
so you could carry out your duties.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:50.370
But what did the world give you in return?

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.790
Only death and suffering!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.500
There's no room for discussion.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:57.710
When you neglect your work and fool around,

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:00.340
others are forced to work even harder to make up for it.

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:04.220
You fail to realize that and think only of yourself

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:07.350
to disparage the sole reason for your birth.

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:08.970
I cannot call such a person my daughter!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:14.600
You know, I loved you, Mom.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.360
You rarely smiled, but you were always so kind.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:22.900
You were like a cool superhero to me, protecting the world.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:29.660
That's why I'll never acknowledge the institution that worked you to death, the Tsukuyomi Shrine.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:33.620
No matter how noble and respectable the role is,

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.670
being a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden is worthless!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:40.420
We're humans, not gods,
so there's nothing we can do,

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:42.300
but we can still have happy lives!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:45.050
I am dead and have no heart for your words to reach.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:06.360
So far away!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.360
Jeez!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.700
I thought I'd save you, Mamarin,

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.790
but I didn't know where you were!

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:16.330
I just followed Kagami-nee the other time I was here!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.500
I didn't know how to get here, so I got lost!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:25.760
I kept on walking, but I ended up back at the school.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:30.510
So I asked a policeman, but all
I remembered was that it was in Kyushu.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.680
The officer yelled at me saying, "Stop messing with me!"

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:36.730
But I didn't do a single thing wrong!

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:40.610
I won't forgive you!

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:43.530
I'll take down the villain that did bad things to my sisters

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:45.240
and go back home with Mamarin and Paparin!

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:48.360
She seems to be a terribly
dependable helper for you.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.870
Mamarin, lend me this.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.960
Tama, how...?

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.130
Gods do not exist in a single location.

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:06.630
The greater their divine power is,
the wider the area in which they exist.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:10.970
Their existence is only perceptible by humans when in a recognizable form,

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:13.850
which may be directly rendered in the minds of humans, abstracting their true nature.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:17.850
These constructions can be recreated at will, allowing for apparent teleportation.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:22.230
I'm in elementary school, so I don't understand complicated stuff!

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:26.230
It's not about who's smarter. It's about who tries harder!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:27.740
What?!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:32.240
She teleported the divine sword to occupy the same space as the demon sword!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.490
What's going on?

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:34.990
According to the legends,

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.200
the demon sword Slash of Heavenly Wings

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.500
is more brittle than the divine sword Gathering Clouds of Heaven!

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.000
Here, Mamarin.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.890
Mamarin was calling you her mom.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.180
You dummy!

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.890
Mamarin was crying!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:02.310
You're her mom! Don't do mean things to your daughter!

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:09.650
I was... eaten?!

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:13.360
How can she eat divine beings?

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:15.580
I see!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:17.950
You're one of the gods of the new generation!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:22.000
God of the next generation prepared to take over from the last!

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.580
Impossible!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:29.760
We've been preserving the ancient myth, one of the most beautiful in the world, for a long time.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:33.180
And our sun god intends to put an end to it now?!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:37.060
I won't acknowledge the next generation of gods!

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.980
Th-This is...

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:43.600
The Spell of Rightful Belonging?

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:48.400
A meditative technique for sealing away all that is unearthly!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.860
Sasami...

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:52.240
I'm your mother!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:55.320
I suffered the pain of labor to give birth to you,

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:56.870
yet now you consider me unearthly?!

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:59.490
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.250
The netherworld...

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.620
is where you belong!

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:06.080
Madam!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.880
Thanks for the other day.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:11.880
Why don't we have a conversation about your daughter's future?

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:14.630
End this, evil gods!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.010
Do you not care about what happens to this world?!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.260
I need to restore this nation

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.350
to the way it should be!

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:24.140
Or I will never be able to rest in peace!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:25.900
Sorry, Tama.

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:28.480
I'll be stuck here for a while.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:29.770
Look after the house for me.

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:36.950
Sasami-san?

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:38.530
Sasami-san!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.200
<i>I don't want to talk right now.</i>

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.710
Have some food at least, Sasami-san!

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:46.500
Then...

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.710
<i>I'll have it later. Just leave it.</i>

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:49.590
Got it!

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:50.460
<i>He got that?</i>

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:55.050
Today's meal is my signature dish: special ramen!

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.470
The ramen will get soggy if you don't eat it soon.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:59.970
Today's dessert is my love for you!

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:03.220
<i>I can do without that dessert. Can you take it back?</i>

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.060
All right. That's too bad.

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:06.440
<i>He got that, too?</i>

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:09.360
Oh, there's a package for you.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.270
I'll leave it here with the food.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:14.740
I'll be downstairs, so call if you need anything.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:18.740
Tsurugi?

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:19.740
Hello?

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.160
Hey, it's me!

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:22.660
I got into an accident.

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.540
Can you wire me, like, 500,000 yen to pay off the other guy?

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:27.920
Why are you trying to scam money out of me?!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.750
And I thought you were in the netherworld, Tsurugi.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:34.670
I'm using an elaborate Transformation to send signals from the netherworld.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.760
I'll get tired if the convo drags out too long, so let's keep it short.

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:39.890
O-Okay.

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:44.350
I'll give my cocky little brother a beating before going back,

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:46.680
so look after my little sisters while I'm gone.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.730
Also, as for your mom...

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:54.320
When I dragged her down to the netherworld,

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:56.780
she was nearly destroyed
because Tama ate most of her.

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:59.160
She didn't vanish completely, though,

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.280
so she might be resurrected again later,

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.280
but she shouldn't be able
to do anything for a while.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.490
That's all I wanted to say for now.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:07.250
I see.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.170
Try not to worry about it too much.

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:10.710
Though I guess there's no way you can't.

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:13.920
Still, you stood up against your own mom and chose this path.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.880
It'd be disrespectful to her for you to give up and stall midway.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:18.380
Keep looking ahead and move on.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.260
It's a promise between us, okay?

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.350
I'll try.

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:26.350
I'll try a little harder.

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:29.520
After resting a bit, I'll get back to it.

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:30.770
Yeah.

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:32.560
Just don't push yourself too hard.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:33.520
Good luck.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:38.570
Oh yeah, I picked up something she dropped on the way down.

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:41.320
I sent it to you, so hold on to it.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:41.990
Talk to you later!

00:22:12.440 --> 00:22:14.020
I'm home!

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:16.770
Welcome back, Tama.

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:18.360
I'm glad to see you're okay.

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:20.650
I'm a little tired.

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:24.820
Yes, the battle aside, you really got lost on your way there.

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:26.370
Good work.

00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:28.950
You showed me that you can get things done if you try!

00:22:28.950 --> 00:22:33.370
Anyway, please take care of the singing, too.

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:35.880
Our big sister is hiding in the netherworld,

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:39.300
and Sasami-san is depressed,
so we have nobody else to sing.

00:22:39.300 --> 00:22:41.130
I'll sing with you.

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:42.630
Will you really?

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:45.680
Then I'll try my best!

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:53.310
I look stunned, and you smile!

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:01.240
Let's go home together!

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:07.950
I can hear your voice!

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:14.170
The symphony echoes off into the distance!

00:23:16.130 --> 00:23:17.540
I'm at my limit!

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:20.170
I can't sing anymore!

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:24.260
Oh yeah, Kagami-nee, were you really singing?

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:25.430
I was.

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:31.850
If you couldn't hear me, turn up the volume to maximum and listen again.

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:34.770
It's great that I can count on you to make my life easier.

00:23:34.770 --> 00:23:36.270
Thanks for the compliment!

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:37.980
So easy to manipulate.

00:23:44.700 --> 00:23:47.370
It's time for Lazy Rankings.

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:50.240
Pretty lazy folks, third place:

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:52.120
arms of claw cranes.

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:53.370
Try harder.

00:23:53.370 --> 00:23:54.620
Second place:

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:57.500
ball-point pen that still has ink left but won't write.

00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:59.250
Are you even trying?

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:00.380
First place:

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:02.130
this preview segment.

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:04.510
I can't tell what the next episode is about.

00:24:04.510 --> 00:24:08.300
Next time, episode eight: "Strategic Solitude."
